# Browser
# What the client shows of a cost that depends on the target and of a granted "hexproof from" (CR 601.2c, 601.2f,
# 602.2b; CR 702.11d). Shadowspear's card menu (it has two abilities) says what its Equip {2} costs with each creature
# it could target: {0} with Dwarven Mauler ("equip abilities you activate that target this creature cost {2} less"),
# {2} with the Ornithopter. Dragonfire Blade's Equip {4} targeting the red Mauler costs {4} - {1} (one color) - {2} (the
# Mauler) = {1}. The Blade has one thing to do, so a click goes straight to its targets, whose caption says what the equip
# costs with each; the payment then asks for that total, paid with Mox Jet. Then the Mauler's face lists "Hexproof from
# monocolored" after its own text and the Shadowspear's trample and lifelink, granted by the Blade.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Dwarven Mauler
Mox Jet
Dragonfire Blade
Mox Pearl
Shadowspear
Ornithopter
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x15

