Bot1.Battlefield.Shadowspear.Activate(Ability: Equip; Dwarven Mauler)
? Client.Bot1.Menu = {1}: Permanents your opponents control lose hexproof and indestructible until end of turn.; Equip {2} (costs {0} targeting Dwarven Mauler, {2} targeting Ornithopter)...
