Bot1.Battlefield.Dragonfire Blade.Activate(Dwarven Mauler)
? Client.Bot1.Targeting = Target for Dragonfire Blade / Costs {1} targeting Dwarven Mauler  ·  1 possible target
? Client.Bot1.Prompt.Title = Pay for Dragonfire Blade
? Client.Bot1.Prompt.Detail = {1} of {1} still to pay  ·  tap a land
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Client.Bot1.Battlefield.Dwarven Mauler.Rules = Equip abilities you activate that target this creature cost {2} less to activate. / Trample / Lifelink / Hexproof from monocolored

